  "id": "USN-8987-1",
  "summary": "libuser vulnerabilities",
  "details": "It was discovered that libuser did not properly validate the GECOS field\nwhen changing user information. A local attacker could possibly use this\nissue to corrupt the passwd file, resulting in a denial of service.\n(CVE-2015-3245)\n\nIt was discovered that libuser modified the passwd file in place when\nupdating user information. A local attacker could possibly use this issue\nto cause an inconsistent file state, resulting in a denial of service, or\npossibly escalate privileges. (CVE-2015-3246)",
